5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It is a pleasure to be working with you all. To ensure our next investment is sustainable, I would like to examine the independent checks on holdings' reported figures and the appraisal needs at the last audit.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
