11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Mizuki. A balanced approach is the most serene way to proceed. By looking at these different facets, we can find a path that brings both success and peace of mind to the fund.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
